| `traceability.specs_root` | string | `docs/specs` | a repo-relative directory, no `..`, not reached through a symlink | `scripts/traceability.py` (`read_specs`); `scripts/trace_requirements.py` | Moves where `make trace` reads `kind: spec` documents; a missing directory is refused with exit 2, and so is a document there of another kind that would define a requirement. | where tests are read: `traceability.tests_root` | always |
